:: day0_void [nobr]
<h2>Void   Unconscious</h2>

<<locationImage "void" "The void between one self and the next">>

<p>Nothing.</p>

<p>Not sleep. Not dreaming. Nothing. The kind of absence that is total   no sensation, no thought, no body to feel with or mind to think with. Just dark. Just the void between who I was and who I will be.</p>

<p>Somewhere, very far away, lute strings. Ash. Playing on the bridge. Waiting.</p>

<p>Somewhere, closer, a heartbeat. Mine. New. Beating in a chest that is shaped differently, that holds different organs, that belongs to someone I haven't met yet.</p>

<p>The heartbeat strengthens. The darkness thins. There is something beyond it   light, and cold, and the smell of candles and magic and stone.</p>

<p>Not yet. Not yet.</p>

<p>The darkness holds me a little longer. Just a little longer. The last mercy before the morning.</p>

<<set $d0_void to true>>

/* === PRE-SET DAY 1 VARIABLES (FEMALE ROUTE) === */
<<set $mcName to "Aelindra">>
<<set $mcTitle to "Princess of Aethermere">>
<<set $mcHeight to "5'6\"">>
<<set $mcBust to "A-B cup">>
<<set $mcWaist to "26\"">>
<<set $mcHips to "34\"">>
<<set $mcSensitivity to "Extreme (new body)">>
<<set $mcBreastSize to "A-B">>
<<set $mcPortrait to "aelindra_day1">>
<<set $bodyStatusVisible to true>>
<<day1fInit>>

<div class="day-transition">
  <p>The darkness holds. The heartbeat strengthens. Light gathers at the edges.</p>
  <p class="transition-morning"><em>Tomorrow, someone new opens her eyes.</em></p>
  [[Wake → |day1_wake]]
</div>
